.DS_Store

# Installed or blank virtual disks
**/*.hdd
**/*.vhd
**/*.vhdx
**/*.qcow
**/*.qcow2

# Installation, recovery, and driver media
**/*.img
**/*.ima
**/*.iso
**/*.cue
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
**/*.rar

# Firmware and generated machine state
**/*.rom
**/*.bin
**/*.nvr

# Executable guest software and drivers
**/*.exe
**/*.com
**/*.dll
**/*.vxd
**/*.sys
**/*.SYS
!**/boot-floppy/FDCONFIG.SYS

# Runtime output
**/printer/*
!**/printer/README.md
**/screenshots/*
!**/screenshots/README.md
**/*.log

# Media and state directories are documentation-only in Git
**/disks/*
!**/disks/README.md
**/media/*
!**/media/README.md
**/nvr/*
!**/nvr/README.md
**/boot-floppy/drivers/*
!**/boot-floppy/drivers/README.md
